      "markdown": "## System of linear equations\n\nA collection of one or more equations involving the same variables.\n\nExample:\n\n $$ \\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x_{1}+3x_{2}+4x_{3}&=5\\\\ 5x_{3}+6x_{4}&=7\\end{aligned}\\right. $$ \n\n $$ \\begin{cases}2x_{1}+3x_{2}+4x_{3}+0x_{4}=5\\\\0x_{1}+0x_{2}+5x_{3}+6x_{4}=7\\end{cases} $$ \n\nHence it is a system of equations involving the variables  $ x_{1}, x_{2}, x_{3}, x_{4} $.",
